WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.940
The Digital World,

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.050
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.540
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:18.240
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.150
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.660
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:54.730
Nene's brother, Yuu, showed 
up right before our eyes.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:59.670
But Yuu is convinced that 
the Digital World is a game,

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:02.130
and has become a General 
for the Bagra Army.

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.770
It was a big shock for Nene,

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:09.870
but with the encouragement of our 
new Xros Heart member, Mervamon,

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:12.780
she vowed to open Yuu's eyes

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:16.890
and joined us on our way 
to the fourth Kingdom.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:26.640
<b>The Mysterious Cyber Land!</b>

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:26.640
<b>The Girl of the Steel City</b>

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:24.250
The Mysterious Cyber Land! 
The Girl of the Steel City!

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.900
So this is the fourth Kingdom?

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.730
It looks like a city of the future.

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:39.540
But it's awfully quiet.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.980
There's not a soul in sight.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:49.550
Something's coming.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:53.990
That's...

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.020
Whamon of the Bagra Army!

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.260
Intruders detected.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.440
Eliminating at once.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.330
Teleporter activated.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.040
They're Andromon!

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:19.280
They didn't waste time attacking, huh?

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:21.550
That will speed things up!

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.700
He's right. Until we 
defeat the Death General,

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.020
we can't go to the next Kingdom.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.360
<i>I'll go all the way to the last Kingdom,</i>

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:31.490
<i>and I will get Yuu back.</i>

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.730
Shoutmon!

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.010
Okay!

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.310
Ballistamon!

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:54.750
Dorulumon!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.320
Starmons!

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.470
Yes!

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:02.740
DigiXros!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:04.960
DigiXros!

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:09.600
Shoutmon X4!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:13.230
Reload, Greymon!

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:22.440
Reload, Mervamon!

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:24.580
All right!

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:42.560
Three Victorize!

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.100
All right! We got 'em all!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.760
But something's not right.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.600
Yeah.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:57.030
Why aren't they disappearing?

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.680
Also, they didn't speak at all.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.280
As if they don't have souls.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:04.480
Oh?

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:07.020
He's completely empty inside.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.950
What? So they're not Digimon?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:13.250
This one, too. They're just dummies.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.330
You're kidding!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.800
Then how were they moving?

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.290
Intruders detected.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:23.230
Eliminating.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:24.920
They're coming again!

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.830
If we keep fighting an enemy like 
this, we'll only exhaust ourselves!

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:31.480
Okay, let's send the Digimon back 
into the Xros Loaders for now!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.100
Sparrowmon, aim for the teleporter!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.550
We're going in!

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:43.490
Okay!

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:50.060
Is this...

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:53.700
So the Whamon was also mechanical?

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.930
But if it's mechanical, 
someone must be operating it.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.290
That could be the Death General.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.910
Okay, let's search the interior.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.540
Taiki.

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:09.710
If this is Bagra Army property, 
I'll be your guide.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.470
Let's go, Taiki!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.350
Right!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.460
They're here already.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.820
Fine by me!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.190
Rock Damashi!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.160
Drill Buster!

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.870
I sense a Digimon from this direction!

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:34.240
What is it?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.000
There's nobody here.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.380
That can't be right...

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:44.800
Hey.

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:48.120
No way...

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.400
A human?

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.350
Just who are you?!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.850
Kiriha, ask her more nicely.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.800
It's all right. We're friends.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.660
I'm Taiki Kudou. Who are you?

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.440
I'm... Ruka.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:14.280
What are you doing here?!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.160
Kiriha!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.650
Fine. You ask her.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.660
This boy doesn't look scary!

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.790
Yeah, and he's also such

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:29.500
a good-hearted person, 
it's almost stupefying.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.600
Wow! He's stupid, huh?

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:33.430
Uh... well...

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:39.130
This is Cyber Land.

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:41.010
Cyber Land?

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:44.790
I wandered into this city and got lost.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:47.020
But I was caught by the 
Bagra Army right away,

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.510
and they were about to 
take me away somewhere.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.980
Where are the ones who caught you?

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:56.350
They got scared and ran away 
when Whamon was attacked.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:57.580
They ran?

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.760
They may have intended 
to make her a General.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:05.560
Hey, forget about that! 
Let me join your team!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:08.890
Of course. Come with us, Ruka.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:11.400
Really? Yay!

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:14.890
I love you, Taiki! Thank you!

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.090
<i>That's weird...</i>

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:20.240
<i>What happened to that 
Digimon I sensed earlier?</i>

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:22.110
Taiki, come here for a minute.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.480
Don't you think she seems suspicious?

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.190
Well, she is a little strange, but...

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:31.030
Just a hunch, but I think 
there's more to her.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:32.260
Surely not...

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.430
How can you say that?!

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:40.130
Not being suspicious was the 
one thing I had going for me!

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:51.680
Aww, now, don't do that.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.380
I'm going to tell your teacher.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.880
And who's this teacher?

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.000
Oh... I'm sorry!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.890
Dorulumon, you apologize, too!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.220
Why should I?!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:03.960
Anyone would be hurt if they 
were suspected without reason!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.090
Hey...

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.800
I was wrong.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.870
Look me in the eye and say you're sorry.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:13.730
What?!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.230
Dorulumon!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:19.010
Well?

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.830
I'm sorry.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.510
Okay, I'll forgive you!

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.250
What's so funny?!

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.230
S-Stop that!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.500
How cute!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.840
Hey, she said you're cute.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.220
She forgave you. Wasn't that nice?

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.590
<i>What's with her?</i>

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:42.530
<i>Maybe she really is just a child...</i>

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.100
Very good.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.980
This could be entertaining.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:07.060
You sure we shouldn't 
have destroyed Whamon?

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:09.990
We broke the teleporter. It'll be fine.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.230
Oh, you're hungry?

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.690
Yeah, since I had to fight earlier.

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:19.840
I found out where the food is stored.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.420
I'll show you!

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:24.270
Really?! Thanks!

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:29.270
This is the food storehouse.

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:35.710
Sorry. Guess that was a trap.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:40.160
Well, everyone makes mistakes...

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.850
Let's try that again.

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:47.060
Sorry. Wrong one.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.130
Push!

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:53.530
Push push!

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:56.570
Push push push!

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:06.880
Look! Look! The door is opening!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.510
Oh... good...

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:10.910
No, it's not.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.890
They are quite tenacious.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:18.120
But how long will they last?

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.780
Ta-da!

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:21.850
What is this?

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:25.800
They recreate foods from 
the human world here!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.900
Let's dig in!

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:35.280
Isn't finding the Death General 
more important than eating?

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:37.480
Don't be in such a hurry.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:41.560
Taiki! I found some tasty-looking juice!

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.430
Let's drink it together!

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:48.720
That is no ordinary juice.

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:51.870
That is a water spirit I created myself,

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.570
a Red Drippin.

00:11:57.050 --> 00:11:59.110
If they drink it...

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:03.960
This will happen.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:08.270
I can't trust you at all, Shoutmon!

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:10.750
I was going to say the same to you!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.680
I'm finished with you, Taiki!

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.410
Stay away from me, 
you cockroach-headed freak!

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:18.290
And what about you, with all 
that hair all of a sudden?

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.020
It's actually a wig, isn't it?!

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:22.440
Shut up, you stupid humans!

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.070
I'll kick your butt!

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.900
They will lose all trust in each other.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.550
Look! There's some for both of you, too!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:38.910
Drill Buster!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.920
What are you doing, Dorulumon?!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:50.620
I don't... my body reacted 
on its own accord...

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:57.510
Not bad.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.440
But how will you handle this?

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:01.990
Look, look, Nene!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:05.450
The Bagra Army's special skin toner!

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.990
Skin toner?

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:12.560
That is no ordinary skin toner.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.290
That is a water spirit I created myself,

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.150
a Cherry Drippin.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.400
If they use it...

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:27.570
This will happen.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.590
Wow!

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:32.460
My skin is so smooth!

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:34.430
Even I'm enchanted!

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:36.140
Truly a work of art!

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:39.040
Scratch up this beautiful 
body in a fight?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.400
Don't be silly!

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.840
You said it! Let's disband Xros Heart!

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:47.690
They'll become so obsessed with 
themselves, they'll lose their nerve.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.360
Come on, try some!

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.710
Okay...

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.290
Dorulu Tornado!

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:04.270
What are you doing, Dorulumon?!

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.720
It was... kind of a reflex...

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:15.590
Look, Dorulumon! The Bagra 
Army's special dog food!

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.740
I'm not a dog!

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.570
Give it up already!

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.870
As if anything you give us is edible!

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:25.310
You're a Bagra spy, aren't you?!

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.610
Spit it out!

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:36.120
Aww, he made her cry again.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.990
You're getting too angry.

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:41.420
Dorulumon, don't you think you're 
a bit too suspicious of Ruka?

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:42.330
Yeah!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.590
No... but...

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:45.790
She's too loud. Shut her up.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:50.880
Sorry.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.700
I forgive you.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.290
You're so quick to accuse because

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.270
you used to be in the Bagra Army, right?

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.410
How do you know that?

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.750
I heard it from a Bagra soldier.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.590
He said that Bagramon said 
that if Dorulumon comes back,

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.990
he'll make him a Death General.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:10.230
Make Dorulumon a Death General?

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:11.520
Nonsense.

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:14.330
There's no way I'd go back 
to the Bagra Army now.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:19.500
But if you did, your life 
wouldn't be in danger anymore.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.200
Death Generals are the 
head honchos, right?

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:30.340
Ruka, Dorulumon won't go 
back to the Bagra Army.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.180
Right?

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:33.580
Right.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.420
This is all that comes 
of the Drippins' power?

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:45.570
No matter.

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.830
It was still enjoyable enough to watch.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.290
I ate a ton.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.600
I'm stuffed.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:59.030
But it's strange. No enemies 
have turned up at all.

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:01.330
I wonder what happened to Whamon?

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:04.840
I'll go take a look.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.600
Wait, Ruka!

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:09.710
What if the enemy finds you?!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.180
Ruka!

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:16.950
She's gone?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.820
Dorulumon!

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:19.930
Cutemon!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.430
Did you see Ruka?

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:24.700
Dorulumon, why did you suspect Ruka?

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.890
What?

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:28.380
You think too much.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.140
Ruka's not a bad girl.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:33.940
I can prove it. She gave me this.

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:35.110
What is that?

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:39.630
Cutemon! What are you—

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.290
That's a Yellow Drippin.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.930
When it's splashed on you, 
it shocks your body.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:52.260
Who are you?

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.970
You'll find out soon.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.870
A troop of Andromon?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:04.370
You have to hurry or 
Dorulumon will be killed!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:05.300
Guys, we need your help!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.350
All right, just the thing 
to get my digestion going!

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:09.420
Yeah!

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.850
Heavy Speaker!

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:17.620
Dorulumon! Where are you?!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:20.630
Taiki, I don't see Ruka anywhere!

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:21.250
What?

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:30.020
Taiki! We don't have time 
to look for a lost child!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.140
We can't help it.

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:33.230
We have to deal with the 
enemies in front of us first!

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:42.610
Ruka?

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:46.770
Have you awakened?

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:50.880
You're...

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.820
I'm Cutemon...

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.450
Not.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:01.110
I am the Death General 
of the fourth Kingdom,

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.590
Splashmon the Water Tiger.

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:05.900
So that's your true form?

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:08.910
That's right. I can 
manipulate water freely,

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:11.770
and transform it into any form I like.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.960
Now, let me show you 
her true form as well.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:21.760
This is a water spirit I created,

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.400
an Azure Drippin.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:26.410
A servant who acts according to my will.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.540
Her body, by the way, is a dummy.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:39.220
I get it... Those Drippin things 
were making the Andromon move!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.370
Correct.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:43.270
I will be your opponent now.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:46.300
What is it you're trying to gain 
with these weird puppet acts?

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.540
Negative energy.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:52.390
Energy created when people 
doubt one another.

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:54.650
That is my dinner.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:58.500
But a team as buddy-buddy as you all

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:01.560
won't give me negative energy easily,

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.820
so I just had a little fun with you.

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.930
How dare you mess with us?!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.230
Gah!

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:11.830
Is that what you expected me to say?

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:14.240
What?!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.670
Such an attack has no effect on me!

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:23.780
Trident Arm!

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:27.810
Death the Cannon!

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:37.560
Sexy Dynamite!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:48.870
There's no end to them!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.100
Just how many are there?

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.400
<i>I've got a bad feeling...</i>

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.640
Dorulu Tornado!

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.140
Bead-drown!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.820
Bead-drown

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:11.490
gathers up the minuscule amounts 
of chemical components in liquid

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:13.560
to instantly suffocate the opponent.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.500
I have won...

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.400
But I will not kill you.

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:26.040
I must have you watch your 
teammates struggling.

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:27.490
What did you say?!

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:32.580
That's it... That feeling of hatred...

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.330
That is what creates negative energy.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:39.880
Very good.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.200
Keep that up.

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:47.330
Miya Vulcan!

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.700
Heartbreak Shot!

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:54.870
Giga Destroyer!

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:04.950
We did it!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.540
We wiped them all out!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:09.620
Let's go find Dorulumon 
and Ruka, quickly.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:10.320
Yeah.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:15.650
Something's coming.

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:19.920
Another enemy?

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.770
Dorulumon!

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:28.130
You're okay!

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:37.010
Those are...

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:38.780
MetalTyrannomon?

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:42.880
Fire.

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:02.390
It can't be...

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:07.710
Dorulumon!

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:09.690
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:13.210
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:13.210
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:17.150
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.160
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.160
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:33.100
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:26.990
<b>Aquatic 
Mammal Type</b>

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:33.100
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Shaking Pulse</b>

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:29.080
Rukamon.

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:30.530
It can also communicate using the

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:32.480
ultrasonic waves it 
emits from its mouth.

00:22:32.480 --> 00:22:36.730
Ultrasonic waves are sounds 
that humans can't hear.

00:22:36.730 --> 00:22:39.570
Do they cure nerve pain, too?

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:42.680
You're telling me to forgive Dorulumon?!

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:43.960
I trust Dorulumon!

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:45.510
I can't deal with this. 
I'll go my own way.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:46.880
Just as I wanted.

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:48.880
Now that they're caught in my trap,

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:51.320
Xros Heart is done for!

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:52.480
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Xros Heart in Danger of Division!</b>

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>The Water Tiger General's Despicable Trap</b>

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
